1
00:00:00,614 --> 00:00:02,814
(Mrs Cooper:)Shelly does not like change.

2
00:00:02,817 --> 00:00:04,217
(Sheldon:)Oh, true.

3
00:00:04,218 --> 00:00:06,218
(Sheldon:)But all the clenching
in the world will not keep

4
00:00:06,220 --> 00:00:08,350
(Sheldon:)testicles in your abdomen.

5
00:00:09,823 --> 00:00:12,393
(Penny:)Hey, sorry,
got caught up at work.

6
00:00:12,393 --> 00:00:13,393
Hi, Beverly!

7
00:00:13,394 --> 00:00:14,464
(Dr Hofstadter:)Hello.
(giggles)

8
00:00:14,462 --> 00:00:16,632
(Dr Hofstadter:)Oh, okay.

9
00:00:16,631 --> 00:00:17,631
(chuckles)

10
00:00:17,632 --> 00:00:18,702
(Penny:)Sorry, I forgot.

11
00:00:18,699 --> 00:00:20,299
(Sheldon:)You remember my mother.

12
00:00:20,301 --> 00:00:21,301
Oh, yes. Hi, Mary!

13
00:00:21,302 --> 00:00:23,302
(Sheldon:)Good to see you
again, dear.

14
00:00:23,304 --> 00:00:25,074
(Penny:)Ah, yeah, now that's
what I'm talking about.

15
00:00:26,506 --> 00:00:29,346
(Leonard:)So, Mom, you haven't seen Penny
since we got engaged.

16
00:00:29,343 --> 00:00:31,343
(Penny:)Oh, yeah, let me
show you the ring.

17
00:00:31,345 --> 00:00:32,515
(Dr Hofstadter:)Oh, lovely.

18
00:00:32,513 --> 00:00:34,583
(Dr Hofstadter:)Must have been
very expensive.

19
00:00:34,582 --> 00:00:35,582
(Sheldon:)Oh, no, not at all.

20
00:00:35,583 --> 00:00:37,753
(Sheldon:)No, we, uh, found
a place online

21
00:00:37,752 --> 00:00:40,652
(Sheldon:)that, uh, repurposes
diamond drill bits.

22
00:00:42,722 --> 00:00:45,192
(Leonard:)We did not. That's not true.

23
00:00:45,192 --> 00:00:48,592
(Leonard:)Can I speak to you alone
for a second?

24
00:00:48,596 --> 00:00:49,926
(Sheldon:)Oh, sure.

25
00:00:49,931 --> 00:00:51,931
(Leonard:)It came from Tiffany's.
(chuckles)

26
00:00:51,933 --> 00:00:53,363
(Sheldon:)You mean the box, right?

27
00:00:53,367 --> 00:00:54,637
Keep walking!

28
00:00:57,604 --> 00:01:01,604
(Penny:)Really doesn't matter to me
how much he spent on the ring.

